internal/canonical/deflate contains a frozen copy of the DEFLATE encoder from
the Go standard library (compress/flate), Copyright (c) 2009 The Go Authors,
licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License. The copy is deliberately pinned: the
DevProof bundle format commits to exact compressed bytes, so the encoder cannot
be allowed to track Go toolchain releases. See internal/canonical/deflate/LICENSE
for the full license text and docs/decisions.md (DP-016) for the rationale.

